Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue.** The parser reads dates month first, and our tenants write the day
first. The fix is queued.

<Callout>
Closed 5 October. Not one issue after all: the merge held two problems. The parser problem
(379 reports) is fixed — dates now parse day/month for EU locales. The booking-v3 hint
problem (33 reports) is won't fix — the form is retired. The split is recorded on the
4471-two-causes page.
</Callout>

